  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Animate the texture on the specified face/faces by setting the texture scale and offset.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>Mode / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/bit_field" target="_blank">mode</a></td>
          <td>Mask of Mode flags</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>Face / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/face" target="_blank">face</a></td>
          <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Face" target="_blank">face</a> number or <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/ALL_SIDES" target="_blank">ALL_SIDES</a></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>SizeX / sizex</td>
          <td>Horizontal frames (ignored for <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/ROTATE" target="_blank">ROTATE</a> and <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/SCALE" target="_blank">SCALE</a>)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>SizeY / sizey</td>
          <td>Vertical frames (ignored for <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/ROTATE" target="_blank">ROTATE</a> and <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/SCALE" target="_blank">SCALE</a>)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>float</span></td>
          <td>Start / start</td>
          <td>Start position/frame number (or radians for <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/ROTATE" target="_blank">ROTATE</a>)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>float</span></td>
          <td>Length / length</td>
          <td>Number of frames to display (or radians for <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/ROTATE" target="_blank">ROTATE</a>)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
